# Bootstrap package for organization (tenant) application-level concerns.
#
# The Organization aggregate root (primary tenant boundary) is owned
# by the devflow-auth module:
#   com.devflow.modules.auth.domain.Organization
#
# This package holds application-level organization concerns:
# tenant context resolution, organization context switching,
# and organization-scoped request filtering.
#
# Reference: docs/architecture/DOMAIN_MODEL.md §3.1
# Reference: docs/security/AUTHORIZATION_MODEL.md §8 (Multi-Tenant Authorization)
